  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Issued in a round plastic screw-top medicine bottle ca. 40 mm in diameter and 50 mm high. The label on the bottle reads: "antiDoctos : concentrados de sabiduría popular : frasco con 10 perlas ; fórmula: inspiración, reflexión." The ten "pearls of popular wisdom" are in the form of ten numbered slips of paper, each containing an aphorism. The bottle also contains three pieces of chewing gum and a one gumball.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The title and publishing information are taken from 2 unnumbered sheets in the bottle.</subfield>
  </datafield>
